/v1/","context":{"app_id":4601110,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4601110","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T09:04:51Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4796250","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4601110-1844115010493071","game_id":"steam-4601110","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo just got better!","summary":"After the initial wave of excitement, I went back to the demo and noticed… a few loose ends. Some interactions needed a proper response, a few bugs had slipped through, and there were some missed opportunities for funny bits.So, after a full day of crying in the bathtub, I pulled myself together and put together a new, improved version of the demo!Here’s what’s new:Updated backgrounds: Paco’s home at night, Café Ramirez, the Bodeguita intro (it had a crappy rain effect and now it’s way better th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T19:13:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010493071","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4601110-1840944183773223","game_id":"steam-4601110","kind":"update","title":"Festivals Update","summary":"Here’s what´s going on with festivals:I don’t want to exaggerate, but Tiny Teams CHANGED MY LIFE. Smokey Mike’s wishlists tripled in a few days, so the down payment on my yacht is finally within reach! But real talk: I'm genuinely overwhelmed by the response and all the positive feedback.IDA Fest also brought in a great wave of Argentinean players, who get the added bonus of recognizing some very familiar backgrounds.Smokey has been selected for IAM Gaming Expo, meaning in October we will have o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T07:35:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183773223","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4601110-1836506165545146","game_id":"steam-4601110","kind":"announcement","title":"The Curtain Rises!","summary":"After a small battle with platform bureaucracy, the Smokey Mike demo is finally playable!It’s around 30 minutes long and includes the beginning of the game: a casino show, Paco’s apartment, and a second performance at a bar.Any feedback would mean a lot and will help the game keep growing. I’m making it with all the effort and care in the world, out of love for comedy and definitely not because I’m expecting millions to start pouring into my bank account.Thank you so much for following the proje","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T08:01:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165545146","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4601110-1832065502823372","game_id":"steam-4601110","kind":"announcement","title":"Smokey Mike selected for GameSpain Direct Summer Fest","summary":"Smokey Mike has been selected as one of the twenty games featured in GameSpain Direct Summer Fest, presented by ClemmyGames this June (date TBA).We’re incredibly honored to be part of the showcase and can’t wait to share more soon.See you at the event!Smokey Mike fue seleccionado como uno de los veinte juegos que formarán parte de GameSpain Direct Summer Fest, presentado por ClemmyGames este junio (fecha a confirmar).Estamos muy felices de formar parte del showcase y pronto compartiremos más nov","occurre